{"id":"n24775-3-7","stage":2,"title":"자매 · 姐妹","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24775-3-7-1","ko":"자매님, 정말 오랜만에 뵙네요.","zh":"姊妹，真是好久不见了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자매님,","meaning":"姐妹","explanation":"자매：姐妹；님：尊称后缀。","readings":[{"term":"자매","audio":"/audio/ae332ac7883e426a7068.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24775","senseId":"3","lemma":"자매","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자매님","audio":"/audio/39357e9ec3d261f626e3.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오랜만에","audio":"/audio/cf175d7879a1bf3c7749.mp3"}},{"text":"뵙네요.","meaning":"拜见","explanation":"뵙다：拜见；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"뵙다","audio":"/audio/3c13f85c4383e3b7b8c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62815","senseId":"1","lemma":"뵙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뵙네요","audio":"/audio/390f4c1bb886c7ba2249.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ae332ac7883e426a","term":"자매","zh":"姐妹","audio":"/audio/ae332ac7883e426a7068.mp3","entryId":"24775","definition":"基督教信徒之间用于指称女性信徒。","pronunciation":["자매"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"3c13f85c4383e3b7","term":"뵙다",